uest matches VAR:three_point_attempts_or_luck (0.74); FAM:SF13 auto_measures VAR:three_point_attempts_or_luck"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Within-game did_adapt toward SHOULD counters improves PPP", "auto_outcome_status": "artifact", "observed_hypothesis": "Offenses that shift toward the counter play types for the inferred opponent scheme gain PPP later in the game.", "observed_result": ["[APPA-003] 531 rows with inferred scheme; 249 adapted (46.9%); adapters +0.0701 (n=239) vs non-adapters +0.0121 (n=269), advantage +0.0580 PPP; DROP +0.1001, SWITCH -0.0436, HELP +0.0450.", "[APPM-013] Adapter dPPP +0.0613 vs +0.0131; advantage +0.0482 PPP, p=0.0199. SWITCH subgroup reversed (-0.0160).", "[CHT-018] First run: adapters n=229 mean dPPP +0.0613 vs non-adapters; later 586 rows, 90.6% inferable, adapters +0.0701 vs non-adapters +0.0121, lift +0.058 (n=508). T1: no-signal baseline is highest dPPP so +0.05 lift  [cut; read_family for the full text]"]}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:selection_or_regression_to_the_mean"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-068", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-068: Game retrospective template preview OKC vs PHX (unpopulated)", "score": 0.608, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-063 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPA-068", "request matches VAR:three_point_attempts_or_luck (0.74); FAM:SF-APPA-068 auto_measures VAR:three_point_attempts_or_luck"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Game retrospective template preview OKC vs PHX (unpopulated)", "auto_outcome_status": "untestable", "observed_hypothesis": "Pre-game vs halftime vs post-game pipeline runs on OKC-PHX Game 1 can be compared to observed stats.", "observed_result": "All sections [MODELED pending] / [DELTA pending] / [OBSERVED pending]. Spearman 0.54 and MAE 0.0922 are copied from the holdout rank study, not computed here.", "auto_failure_mechanism": "A_unanswerable (question not answerable with the data or design)", "observed_failure_evidence": "Pipeline runs were never supplied; 0 possession sequences in the train split field.", "observed_sample_and_power": "NOT_RECORDED", "auto_validation_status": "same_pipeline_validation; evidence: APPA-068: 'pending]. spearman 0.54 and mae 0.0922 are copied from the holdout rank study, not computed here. placeholder preview, not a c'", "observed_verdict": "abandoned"}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF-APPA-063"}]}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-031", "label": "Study family SF-APPA-031: Case studies: alignment with engine mix vs ORtg (+3.3 claim)", "score": 0.575, "reached_via": ["FAM:SF-APPA-063 auto_related_family (record_link_related_to) FAM:SF-APPA-031", "request matches DS:Box_score_and_traditional_stats (0.69); FAM:SF-APPA-031 auto_uses_dataset DS:Box_score_and_traditional_stats"], "attributes": {"observed_research_question": "Case studies: alignment with engine mix vs ORtg (+3.3 claim)", "auto_outcome_status": "supported", "observed_hypothesis": "Games where the team mix was closest to the engine recommendation score more after strength adjustment.", "observed_result": "Closest vs most-deviated tercile +3.3 ORtg adjusted (raw +5.2); Spearman rho >0.4 in 62% of games. Cases: GSW-LAL rho 1.00 coachable +28.0 ORtg; MIA-BOS rho 0.80 aligned residual +27.9; NYK-LAL rho 0.80 coachable +25.0;  [cut; read_family for the full text]", "auto_failure_mechanism": "E_unclear (mechanism unclear from the records)", "observed_failure_evidence": "No CI or test reported for +3.3; in-game PT ranking used as rho target shares outcome data; 3 of 6 cases are labeled honest counter-examples; every kernel rec is CUT-heavy."}, "relationships": [{"rel": "auto_limited_by", "node": "LIM:label_or_classification_error"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:BASE_RATE"}, {"rel": "auto_has_risk", "node": "RISK:LABEL_ERROR"}, {"rel": "auto_related_family", "node": "FAM:SF32"}]}], "n_results": 10}

